# Copy to BOTH files — they are read by different runtimes:
#   .env       → Node tooling (astro sync, eslint, prettier)
#   .dev.vars  → Cloudflare workerd, which is what `npm run dev` actually runs on
# Both are gitignored. workerd does NOT read .env.
#
# Local Supabase (`npx supabase start`) prints these; the hosted project has them
# under Settings → API. Use the `anon` / public key, never the service-role key.
#
# For deployed environments these are NOT read from a file — set them with:
#   npx wrangler secret put SUPABASE_URL
#   npx wrangler secret put SUPABASE_KEY
#
# Both are declared `optional: true` in astro.config.mjs, so a build and a deploy
# SUCCEED without them and serve a silently auth-disabled site. See
# context/deployment/deploy-plan.md, Phase 5.

SUPABASE_URL=###
SUPABASE_KEY=###
